OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy,
OL,7,Fspreading northeast. This rain will
OL,8,Fclear to showers by midday with the
OL,9,Fafternoon becoming dry and brighter.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and bright conditions
OL,12,Fcontinue through the evening. The
OL,13,Fnight will stay dry with clear periods
OL,14,Fas the fresh westerly wind gradually
OL,15,Feases down.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells for much of the day becoming
OL,19,Fcloudy from the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
