OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of heavy rain Monday
OL,7,Fthis turning showery Tuesday. Dry for
OL,8,Fa time Tuesday night into Wednesday
OL,9,Fmorning. Heavy showery rain Wednesday
OL,10,Fafternoon.
